        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana S44058TT,  4\" x 4\"  x 5/8\" Radius Leaf x Square Corner Leaf THERMA-TRU Hinge</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSold and priced as a pair, these 4\" security door hinges are made out of steel. They have a 5/8\" radius on one leaf and a square corner on the other. For use on doors that open outward where the hinge pins are outside the door. These extra <b>security door hinges</b> have locking tabs that join the 2 hinge leaves together when door is closed. This holds a closed door in place even if the door hinges are tampered with (if hinge pins are removed or cut).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDirect fit replacement for THERMA-TRU door hinges (4 Inch Square & Rounded Corner). \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackage includes a pair of hinges (2), matching finish flathead, Phillips Drive #10 x 1\" wood screws.  Utilizes template screw hole pattern for use with wood or metal doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-S44058T-Specifications.gif?v=1704354670\" width=\"600\" height=\"284\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana S44058TT Hinge Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 4 Inch Security Door Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: Solid Steel</li>\r\n<li>Height: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: 5/8\" Radius Leaf</li>\r\n<li>Corners: Square Leaf</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 0.085\" (Residential)</li>\r\n<li>Removable Pin</li>\r\n<li>THERMA-TRU Door Hole Pattern</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Pin: Steel</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #10 x 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Security Tabs: Lock Tab to Join Hinge Leaves</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-S44058TT.pdf?v=1704262302\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana S44058TT Hinge Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold in Pairs (2 Hinges)</b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "4 x 4 x 5/8 Radius Leaf x Square Corner Residential Steel Hinge",
                "description": "4 Inch Security Door Hinge Deltana S44058TT - Sold and priced as a pair, these 4 inch security door hinges are made out of steel. They have a 5/8 inch radius on one leaf and a square corner on the other. For use on doors that open outward where the hinge pins are outside the door. These extra security door hinges have locking tabs that join the 2 hinge leaves together when door is closed. This holds a closed door in place even if the door hinges are tampered with (if hinge pins are removed or cut).",
